WEBVTT

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.000
CA: Hoe groot?

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.000
WK: Ek dink dit sal meer
as 20 watt produseer.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:10.870
CA: So dit sal besproeiing
vir die hele dorpie genereer?

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:12.000
WK: Ja.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:16.130
CA: Wow. En so jy's besig om
met mense hier by TED te gesels

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:19.000
om mense te kry wat dalk
op ’n manier kan help

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.000
om hierdie droom waar te maak?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:25.600
WK: Ja, as hulle my kan help
met materiale, ja.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.280
CA: En as jy dink aan jou lewe vorentoe,

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.000
jy's nou 19,